msgctxt "#30105"
msgid "Catalogue (TMDB)"
msgstr "Catalogue (TMDB)"

msgctxt "#30106"
msgid "This product uses TMDB and the TMDB APIs but is not endorsed, certified, or otherwise approved by TMDB."
msgstr "This product uses TMDB and the TMDB APIs but is not endorsed, certified, or otherwise approved by TMDB."

msgctxt "#30107"
msgid "TMDB API key"
msgstr "Cle API TMDB"

msgctxt "#30108"
msgid "Required to browse catalogues. A key is free from themoviedb.org, under Settings then API."
msgstr "Necessaire pour parcourir les catalogues. La cle est gratuite sur themoviedb.org, dans Reglages puis API."

msgctxt "#30109"
msgid "Include adult titles"
msgstr "Inclure les titres pour adultes"

msgctxt "#30110"
msgid "Only affects genre, year and anime browsing, which are the ones filtered server-side."
msgstr "N'affecte que la navigation par genre, annee et anime, les seules filtrees cote serveur."

msgctxt "#30111"
msgid "Anime detection"
msgstr "Detection des animes"

msgctxt "#30112"
msgid "TMDB has no anime category. Either match the anime keyword, which is precise but relies on volunteer tagging, or take all Japanese animation, which is broader but catches non-anime."
msgstr "TMDB n'a pas de categorie anime. Soit on s'appuie sur le mot-cle anime, precis mais dependant du travail des benevoles, soit sur toute l'animation japonaise, plus large mais qui attrape des non-animes."

msgctxt "#30113"
msgid "Anime keyword (precise)"
msgstr "Mot-cle anime (precis)"

msgctxt "#30114"
msgid "Japanese animation (broad)"
msgstr "Animation japonaise (large)"

msgctxt "#30115"
msgid "No TMDB API key configured. Get a free key at themoviedb.org and add it in the addon settings."
msgstr "Aucune cle API TMDB configuree. Recupere une cle gratuite sur themoviedb.org et renseigne-la dans les reglages."

